    <item>
      <title>我不再做的事</title>
      <link>https://tangbiubiu.github.io/post/wo-bu-zai-zuo-de-shi/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://tangbiubiu.github.io/post/wo-bu-zai-zuo-de-shi/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:19:51 +0800</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<blockquote>
<p>Greg Isenberg 分享了一个自己持续更新的文档，主题是 <a href="https://x.com/gregisenberg/status/1949626889435234360">Thing I&rsquo;m not doing anymore</a><br />
他说这让生活变得美好。我也写一写：</p>
</blockquote>
<ul>
<li>不再评论他人的任何选择（除非你惹到我）</li>
<li>不再跟任何人辩论（除非你惹到我）</li>
<li>不再因为游戏和短视频熬夜</li>
<li>不再每&hellip;</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
      <category>生活</category>
    </item>
